recommend keep-going the terminal family's next agent-doable rung is the drawn prompt -- rendering the shell's editable line with a visible cursor into scooter_view's bounded frame row (still pure, no raw TTY); the live keystroke reader and the Comlink transport between two Constel piers stay the serve gate -- the maintainer's hand
